    "termsOfAccess": "The files are accessible only via Prof.dr. S. Utz. For more information, please see www.redeftiedata.nl.\n\nThe data are collected by GfK. Participants were recruited by the GfK panel. The sample is representative for adult Dutch online users in terms of sex, age, education, and urbanity. \n\nThe numbering of the categories for item ‘V4.Social media gebruik’ differs between data file and questionnaire. The numbering is correct in the data file.",
